CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police has seized a
OL,7,Frecord number of illegal e-bikes and e-
OL,8,Fscooters this year in a new crack down
OL,9,Fon the vehicles.
OL,11,FOfficers seized 29 e-bikes and seven e-
OL,12,Fscooters by Tottenham Court Road
OL,13,FStation on Friday as part of Operation
OL,14,FLexand, which specifically targeted
OL,15,Fillegal electric two-wheelers as part
OL,16,Fof a wider Met initiative to tackle
OL,17,Fphone theft and neighbourhood crime.
OL,19,FIt is the seventh such operation in
OL,20,FLondon this year, with five more
OL,21,Fscheduled through the summer.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,FThe project has helped the Met seize
OL,7,Fmore than 2,500 illegal e-bikes and e-
OL,8,Fscooters in 2026, surpassing the 2,241
OL,9,Fseized in the entirety of 2025.
OL,11,FNew testing kits are being rolled out
OL,12,Fto help efficiently test if a vehicle
OL,13,Fis illegal.
OL,15,FThe technology is used to measure
OL,16,Fwhether the bikes and scooters could
OL,17,Fpropel themselves faster than 15.5mph
OL,18,Fthrough electrically assisted pedals,
OL,19,Fbatteries or throttles.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,FOfficers were stationed at two stop
OL,7,Fsites close to Tottenham Court Road
OL,8,FStation ` a location with a
OL,9,Fdisproportionately high amount of e-
OL,10,Fbike traffic owing to higher crime
OL,11,Frates and phone theft ` with officers
OL,12,Fin plain clothing assisting to pull
OL,13,Fover users and test the bike's speed.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,FIf they were found to be too fast, and
OL,7,Fdrivers were not properly licensed or
OL,8,Finsured, the bikes were taken away to
OL,9,Fbe impounded ` with owners given 14
OL,10,Fdays to provide the correct
OL,11,Fdocumentation before vehicles are
OL,12,Fstripped for recyclable parts and
OL,13,Fdestroyed.
OL,15,FEach test took around a minute and
OL,16,Fdrivers were held up for no more than
OL,17,F15 minutes, with police facing minimal
OL,18,Fdisruption from pulled-over riders and
OL,19,Fpassers-by during the two hours a
OL,20,FPress Association reporter observed on
OL,21,FFriday morning.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,FCommander Neerav Patel, who was
OL,7,Foverseeing the operation, spoke to PA
OL,8,Fas bikes were being tested.
OL,10,FHe said: "We've heard loud and clear
OL,11,Fthat Londoners are fed up of the
OL,12,Fcriminal and antisocial use of e-bikes.
OL,14,F"We recognise that the use of e-bikes
OL,15,F(can be) perfectly legitimate, but
OL,16,Fthere are a vast number of people
OL,17,Fintent on using e-bikes for criminal
OL,18,Fand anti-social uses. We know that e-
OL,19,Fbikes are used in phone snatches,
OL,20,Fparticularly in this part of London."
OL,26,@rD@JOUvD@AOUwD@ApmwD@Hpn|D@eO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,FTwo arrests were made during the
OL,7,Foperation, including one for
OL,8,Fassaulting an emergency worker and
OL,9,Fanother for public order offences,
OL,10,Ftheft and recall to prison.
OL,12,FThe Met is one of just two police
OL,13,Fforces in the country, alongside
OL,14,FNottinghamshire, to deploy the
OL,15,F"rolling roads" technology.
OL,17,FThey have two Dynostar and two more
OL,18,Fportable Wenger test kits that act as
OL,19,Ftreadmills to quickly determine
OL,20,Fwhether a vehicle is legally compliant.
OL,26,@wD@AOUwD@OO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,FOfficers can pull over bikes they
OL,7,Fsuspect to be non-compliant, with
OL,8,Fcommon red flags being speed, the use
OL,9,Fof throttles that enable users to
OL,10,Ftravel at speed without pedalling and
OL,11,Fbig, potentially strapped-on batteries.
OL,13,FCommander Patel added: "We'll stop
OL,14,Friders that we have a reasonable
OL,15,Fsuspicion over the bike, which will be
OL,16,Fput into the device.
OL,26,@uD@XOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,F"This is no different to somebody
OL,7,Fjumping on a motorcycle without
OL,8,Flicense, without any safety gear,
OL,9,Fwithout any insurance as far as the
OL,10,Flaw's concerned."
OL,12,FThe Met said the crackdown was having
OL,13,Fsuccess both statistically and with
OL,14,Fpublic response.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@QO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,FCommander Patel said: "What we are
OL,7,Fdoing is clearly working. Phone theft
OL,8,Fin the West End, increasingly
OL,9,Fperpetrated by thieves riding illegal
OL,10,Fe-bikes, has nearly halved. We'll
OL,11,Fcontinue to do everything we can to
OL,12,Fmake
OL,14,FLondon an even safer city for everyone
OL,15,Fto enjoy."
OL,17,FSuperintendent Luke Baldock, who was
OL,18,FMr Patel's second-in-command on the
OL,19,Foperation, told PA: "Usually we get a
OL,20,Flot of grief when we're out like this
OL,21,Fbut it's been night and day.
OL,26,@nD@WOUwD@JO]{D@UOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,F"Just speaking to the members of the
OL,7,Fpublic passing by, everyone is saying
OL,8,Fthank goodness you're doing something
OL,9,Fabout this. We took a roadshow to all
OL,10,Fof the 32 boroughs and one of the main
OL,11,Fissues the public always complained
OL,12,Fabout was speed bikes.
OL,14,F"They go far too fast, so they're
OL,15,Fdangerous. It makes people unsafe
OL,16,Fbecause they enable other types of
OL,17,Fcrime like robbery.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,F"We're using the 'rolling road'
OL,7,Fsolution. That means we're detecting
OL,8,Fmore illegal e-bikes (and it's)
OL,9,Fallowing us to seize many more."
OL,11,FSome of the bikes seized, made by
OL,12,Fbrands such as Engwe, Fiido, Hitway
OL,13,Fand Super73, recorded speeds in excess
OL,14,Fof 27 miles per hour.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@VpmpD@_pnqD@`O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G11/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,FBy seizing more of them, the Met said
OL,7,Fit is reducing local crime, with
OL,8,Fneighbourhood offences down by 14% in
OL,9,Fthe 12 months to June compared with
OL,10,Fthe previous year in London ` the
OL,11,Fequivalent of 35,000 fewer reported
OL,12,Foffences.
OL,14,FThis includes 23,311 fewer thefts from
OL,15,Fperson (down 23%) and 2,943 fewer
OL,16,Fpersonal robberies (11% lower).
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G12/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785156513
OL,3,CMet seize record number of illegal e-
OL,4,Cbikes and e-scooters
OL,6,FMr Baldock told PA that an increased
OL,7,Fnumber of seized bikes has prompted
OL,8,Fthem to start talks with charities and
OL,9,Fprisons to give young people work de-
OL,10,Fassembling the bikes and making them
OL,11,Froad safe, while Mr Patel said
OL,12,Feducational work was being done with
OL,13,Fthe gig economy.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G13/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
